cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DEDL-O, please cite it as below."
title: "Data Ecosystem Description Language Ontology (DEDL-O)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
abstract: >-
  DEDL-O is a reusable ontology for describing the technical architecture of
  data ecosystems, their processes and the connection between both. This
  integration layer states which process step calls which API endpoint and how
  data is mapped between them, which neither architecture nor process
  vocabularies can express on their own.
